# Implementation Plan - 100% Framework-Isolated Template System

Enforce total, 100% framework isolation across all supported packages (`django/`, `flutter/`, `react/`, `vuejs/`, `wordpress/`). Every framework directory will be completely self-contained and independently shippable with its own agents, skills, architecture plans, cross-platform automation (`linux/`, `windows/`, `macos/`, `git/`), Docker manifests (`docker/`), Graphify integration (`templates/graphify/`), and Git ignore rules (`git-ignore/`).

---

## Core Principles

1. **Strict Framework Isolation**: Every framework directory (`django/`, `flutter/`, `react/`, `vuejs/`, `wordpress/`) contains EVERYTHING it needs inside its own folder. No framework depends on any files outside its directory.
2. **Duplication is Acceptable**: Automation scripts, Docker configs, Graphify setup scripts, Git hooks, and skills are mirrored and customized per framework inside `<framework>/automation/`, `<framework>/docker/`, `<framework>/templates/`, and `<framework>/skills/`.
3. **Strict Safety**: Read-only reference inspection of `weighingscale_app`, `rawadhai_backend`, and `rawadhai_frontend`. **NEVER** edit, rename, move, or modify any files in those three projects.

---

## Detailed Structure per Framework

Each framework directory (`django/`, `flutter/`, `react/`, `vuejs/`, `wordpress/`) will contain:

```text
<framework>/
├── AGENTS.md                                    # Framework multi-agent entry point
├── AGENT_USAGE.md                               # Step-by-step developer usage guide
├── agents/                                      # Framework agent roles (planner, implementer, tester, reviewer...)
├── skills/                                      # Framework skills (standards, ORM/state, graphify, docker, hooks...)
├── architecture_plans/                          # Framework architecture plans
├── automation/                                  # Framework-specific cross-platform automation
│   ├── README.md
│   ├── setup-project.sh                         # Framework project setup script (Linux/macOS)
│   ├── setup-project.ps1                        # Framework project setup script (Windows PowerShell)
│   ├── linux/                                   # Linux Bash scripts (.sh)
│   ├── macos/                                   # macOS Bash scripts (.sh)
│   ├── windows/                                 # Windows PowerShell (.ps1) & CMD (.cmd)
│   └── git/                                     # Cross-platform Git hooks (pre-commit, post-commit)
├── docker/                                      # Framework Docker configurations
│   ├── README.md
│   ├── Dockerfile
│   ├── Dockerfile.dev
│   ├── Dockerfile.prod
│   ├── docker-compose.yml
│   ├── docker-compose.dev.yml
│   └── env.docker.example
├── templates/                                   # Framework templates & setup scripts
│   └── graphify/
│       ├── .graphifyignore
│       ├── graphify-setup.sh
│       ├── graphify-setup.ps1
│       ├── clean-graphify.sh
│       └── clean-graphify.ps1
└── git-ignore/                                  # Framework Git ignore templates & guidance
    ├── README.md
    └── gitignore.template
```

